  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "r20261110-a01",
      "title": "The Red Balloon",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "For her birthday, Sari got a big red balloon. She held the string tightly as she walked with her mother to the park.",
        "Suddenly, a strong wind blew. The string slipped from Sari’s fingers. The red balloon flew up, up, up, over the trees. Sari cried all the way home.",
        "That afternoon, there was a knock at the door. A boy from the next street stood there, holding the red balloon. \"It fell into our garden,\" he said. Sari smiled and said thank you a hundred times. That evening, she tied the balloon to her chair very, very carefully."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "balloon": "balon",
        "tightly": "erat-erat",
        "blew": "bertiup",
        "slipped": "terlepas",
        "knock": "ketukan",
        "tied": "mengikat",
        "carefully": "dengan hati-hati"
      },
